    <string name="hw_tips_title">Hardware tips</string>
    <string name="hw_tips">R16 (trimmer) sets the signal level to the ESP32: adjust so s1 without metal sits around 1500–2500 and never reaches 4095. R7 (390 Ω) is the coil damping resistor: too high gives ringing, too low a slower decay. Re-balance after every change.</string>
